#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:12
msgid "Silence becomes data"
msgstr "把静默变成数据"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:13
msgid ""
"Ask for AVIF and get PNG, and nothing throws. So the format is read back "
"off the blob, and result.degraded is empty only when the output is exactly "
"what you asked for."
msgstr "要 AVIF 拿到 PNG，而且什么都不抛。所以格式是从 blob 上读回来的，只有输出完全如你所愿时 result.degraded 才是空的。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:16
msgid "A byte budget, not a quality number"
msgstr "给的是字节预算，不是质量数字"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:17
msgid ""
"Quality is bisected to the largest size that fits, then the image is shrunk "
"if quality alone cannot get there. Two axes, a capped attempt count, and "
"the count is reported."
msgstr "二分质量找到能塞进预算的最大结果；光靠质量到不了就缩图。两个轴、有上限的尝试次数，而且次数会如实汇报。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:20
msgid "HEIC without shipping libheif"
msgstr "HEIC 不用打包 libheif"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:21
msgid ""
"Detected from the file's magic bytes, since iOS often leaves the mime type "
"blank, and decoded through heic-to imported on demand."
msgstr "靠文件的 magic bytes 识别（iOS 经常把 mime type 留空），再交给按需 import 的 heic-to 解码。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:24
msgid "Zero dependencies by default"
msgstr "默认零依赖"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:25
msgid ""
"The canvas engine is native. WASM codecs live behind a separate entry "
"point, so AVIF costs a bundle only where it is used."
msgstr "canvas 引擎是浏览器原生的。WASM codec 放在单独的入口后面，所以 AVIF 只在用到它的地方产生体积。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:33
msgid ""
"Compress an image to a byte budget in the browser - and find out what "
"actually happened."
msgstr "在浏览器里把图片压到目标体积 —— 并且知道实际发生了什么。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:43
msgid "Try it here"
msgstr "在线试试"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:49
msgid "Read the docs"
msgstr "阅读文档"

#: src/app/[lang]/playground/page.with.tsx:11
#: src/app/[lang]/playground/page.with.tsx:21
msgid "Playground"
msgstr "Playground"

#: src/app/[lang]/playground/page.with.tsx:12
msgid "Squeeze an image under a byte budget in your own browser."
msgstr "在你自己的浏览器里把图片压进字节预算。"

#: src/app/[lang]/playground/page.with.tsx:23
msgid ""
"Pick an image and watch the search run. Everything below is the real "
"{appName} running in this tab - no server, no upload."
msgstr "选一张图，看搜索怎么跑。下面全都是真正的 {appName} 在这个标签页里运行 —— 没有服务器，不会上传。"

#: src/app/layout.with.tsx:22
msgid ""
"Compress an image to a byte budget in the browser, and find out what "
"actually happened."
msgstr "在浏览器里把图片压到目标体积，并且知道实际发生了什么。"

