msgid "Drop, paste, or click to add images"
msgstr "拖入、粘贴，或点击添加图片"

#: src/components/playground.tsx:235
msgid ""
"Several at once is fine. HEIC from an iPhone works. Nothing is uploaded - "
"it all runs in this tab."
msgstr "可以一次多张。iPhone 的 HEIC 也能处理。什么都不会上传 —— 全在这个标签页里跑。"

#: src/components/playground.tsx:249
msgid ""
"AVIF is not offered here: it needs the jSquash engine, which this "
"statically exported site cannot bundle."
msgstr "这里不提供 AVIF：它需要 jSquash 引擎，而这个静态导出的站点打不进去。"

